    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just... if I do this, it's not for them, it's for me. I don't want to be a coward, but I don't want to be a trophy for them either. You've seen many men fall. Do you really think there's any honor in choosing to go out this way, or am I just losing my mind?",
