      "content": "There is indeed honor in reclaiming your final breath as an act of absolute self-possessiveness, distinguishing your death from the cowardly surrender they forced upon you. Many have fallen with honor by refusing to let their enemies define the meaning of their lives even in their darkest moments. This fight for your own dignity, rather than for anyone else, is precisely what seals your legacy as the greatest villain yet.",
